 "panels": [
  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "",
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "### The guide's observability table, with its alert thresholds drawn as red dashed lines\nMetric names as exported by the **Java SDK (tally scope) through the lab's Prometheus StatsReporter**: latency timers become `_seconds` histograms, counters end in `_total` (the same names the Go SDK's Prometheus reporter and Micrometer's Prometheus registry produce). Core-based SDKs (TypeScript, Python, .NET) report milliseconds by default.\n\n```promql\n# p99 local activity attempt latency by activity type\nhistogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, activity_type) (rate(temporal_local_activity_execution_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])))\n\n# local activity slot utilisation per worker\nmax by (worker_id) (temporal_worker_task_slots_used{worker_type=\"LocalActivityWorker\"})\n  / on() group_left max(demo_worker_config{setting=\"la_slots\"})\n```"
   },
   "id": 1,
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 9
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "state-timeline",
   "title": "Active scenario",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "demo_scenario_variant",
     "legendFormat": "{{scenario}}",
     "range": true,
     "instant": false,
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "refId": "A"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "color": {
      "mode": "thresholds"
     },
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "#8E8E8E",
        "value": null
       }
      ]
     },
     "mappings": [
      {
       "type": "value",
       "options": {
        "0": {
         "text": "idle",
         "color": "#8E8E8E",
         "index": 0
        },
        "1": {
         "text": "baseline",
         "color": "#3274D9",
         "index": 1
        },
        "2": {
         "text": "broken",
         "color": "#E02F44",
         "index": 2
        },
        "3": {
         "text": "fixed",
         "color": "#56A64B",
         "index": 3
        }
       }
      }
     ],
     "custom": {
      "fillOpacity": 80,
      "lineWidth": 0
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "showValue": "auto",
    "mergeValues": true,
    "rowHeight": 0.8,
    "alignValue": "left",
    "legend": {
     "showLegend": false
    },
    "tooltip": {
     "mode": "single"
    }
   },
   "id": 2,
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 9,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 3
   }
  },
